{"id":"65b448b4269ca18e","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-first-order-reduction.md","title":"一阶多一归约","display":"df-first-order-reduction — 一阶多一归约","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-first-order-reduction","aliases":["29-df-first-order-reduction"],"display":"df-first-order-reduction — 一阶多一归约","depends_on":["[[29-df-standard-inputs]]","[[29-df-fo-query]]","[[29-df-struc]]"],"source_locator":"Definition2.11, pp.28–29, scans43–44; Provisos1.14–1.15 pp.13–14 scans28–29","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；陈述已对照，证明核对范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-first-order-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-first-order-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-first-order-reduction — 一阶多一归约"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4563061cac782dab\" href=\"?note=4563061cac782dab\" title=\"29-df-standard-inputs\">29-df-standard-inputs</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"75340800e8905793\" href=\"?note=75340800e8905793\" title=\"29-df-fo-query\">29-df-fo-query</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition2.11, pp.28–29, scans43–44; Provisos1.14–1.15 pp.13–14 scans28–29"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；陈述已对照，证明核对范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau\\)</span> 为有限关系词汇，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\">\\(\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathcal E\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span> 为指定输入、输出域；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal D\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathcal D]\">\\(\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"75340800e8905793\" href=\"?note=75340800e8905793\" title=\"29-df-fo-query\">29-df-fo-query</a>；下式还要求所有合法输入的像在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 内。无域参数的归约采用全体非空有限结构。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu,\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}\">\\(\\nu,\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4563061cac782dab\" href=\"?note=4563061cac782dab\" title=\"29-df-standard-inputs\">29-df-standard-inputs</a>；标准输入归约的查询都携带与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span> 不交的有限关系输入词汇；其实际输入、输出结构词汇分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\cup\\nu\">\\(\\sigma\\cup\\nu\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\cup\\nu\">\\(\\tau\\cup\\nu\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\">\\(\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\\)</span> 见该上游。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo}}^{\\mathcal D,\\mathcal E}\\mathcal B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists k\\geq1\\;\\exists I\\in\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\;(I[\\mathcal D]\\subseteq\\mathcal E\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal D\\;(A\\in\\mathcal A\\leftrightarrow I(A)\\in\\mathcal B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal A\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo}}^{\\mathcal D,\\mathcal E}\\mathcal B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists k\\geq1\\;\\exists I\\in\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\;(I[\\mathcal D]\\subseteq\\mathcal E\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal D\\;(A\\in\\mathcal A\\leftrightarrow I(A)\\in\\mathcal B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo}}\\mathcal B\\coloneqq\\mathcal A\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo}}^{\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma],\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]}\\mathcal B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal A\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo}}\\mathcal B\\coloneqq\\mathcal A\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo}}^{\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma],\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]}\\mathcal B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo,std}}\\mathcal B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\\;\\left(\\sigma\\cap\\nu=\\tau\\cap\\nu=\\varnothing\\land\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\\land\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\land\\exists k\\geq1\\;\\exists I\\in\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma\\cup\\nu,\\tau\\cup\\nu;\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\sigma]]\\;\\bigl(I[\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\sigma]]\\subseteq\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\\;(A\\in\\mathcal A\\leftrightarrow I(A)\\in\\mathcal B)\\bigr)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal A\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo,std}}\\mathcal B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\\;\\left(\\sigma\\cap\\nu=\\tau\\cap\\nu=\\varnothing\\land\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\\land\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\land\\exists k\\geq1\\;\\exists I\\in\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma\\cup\\nu,\\tau\\cup\\nu;\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\sigma]]\\;\\bigl(I[\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\sigma]]\\subseteq\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\\;(A\\in\\mathcal A\\leftrightarrow I(A)\\in\\mathcal B)\\bigr)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 2.11，印刷页28–29、扫描页43–44。保留全非空结构接口，同时显式给出受限合法输入域接口。原书默认的数值关系与两布尔常量约定由下标fo,std恢复；不能把不带数值符号的一般结构FO归约冒充原书的完全性归约。输出域要求也显式检查，不能仅凭定义了关系公式就宣称输出属于某个受限结构类。</p>\n<p>标准归约分支直接展开查询词汇、合法输入域、输出合法性及逐输入成员资格等价，避免在隐藏词汇参数的通用归约记号中把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\">\\(\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\\)</span> 误传为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-结构域。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-standard-inputs","status":"resolved","id":"4563061cac782dab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-standard-inputs]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-query","status":"resolved","id":"75340800e8905793","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-query]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-query","status":"resolved","id":"75340800e8905793","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathcal D]$ 见 [[29-df-fo-query]]；下式还要求所有合法输入的像在 $\\mathcal E$ 内。无域参数的归约采用全体非空有限结构。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-standard-inputs","status":"resolved","id":"4563061cac782dab","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\nu,\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}$ 使用 [[29-df-standard-inputs]]；标准输入归约的查询都携带与 $\\nu$ 不交的有限关系输入词汇；其实际输入、输出结构词汇分别为 $\\sigma\\cup\\nu$、$\\tau\\cup\\nu$。$\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}$ 见该上游。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\sigma,\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathcal D]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu,\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\cup\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\cup\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo}}^{\\mathcal D,\\mathcal E}\\mathcal B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists k\\geq1\\;\\exists I\\in\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\;(I[\\mathcal D]\\subseteq\\mathcal E\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal D\\;(A\\in\\mathcal A\\leftrightarrow I(A)\\in\\mathcal B)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal A\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo}}\\mathcal B\\coloneqq\\mathcal A\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo}}^{\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma],\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]}\\mathcal B.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal A\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo,std}}\\mathcal B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\\;\\left(\\sigma\\cap\\nu=\\tau\\cap\\nu=\\varnothing\\land\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\\land\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\land\\exists k\\geq1\\;\\exists I\\in\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma\\cup\\nu,\\tau\\cup\\nu;\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\sigma]]\\;\\bigl(I[\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\sigma]]\\subseteq\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\\;(A\\in\\mathcal A\\leftrightarrow I(A)\\in\\mathcal B)\\bigr)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false}],"bytes":2888,"backlinks":[{"id":"fe0c97f9faf86d63","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo,std}}$ 及 $\\mathrm L_{\\mathrm{std}},\\mathrm{NL}_{\\mathrm{std}},\\mathrm P_{\\mathrm{std}},\\mathrm{PSPACE}_{\\mathrm{std}}$ 见 [[29-df-first-order-reduction]]、[[29-df-standard-inputs]]。"},{"id":"5dc6da6f374d15c9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak Q$ 为固定词汇范围内的布尔查询集合；每个查询携带其输入词汇。跨词汇的一阶多一归约 $\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo}}$ 见 [[29-df-first-order-reduction]]。"},{"id":"08afaae97db1d476","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"一阶Turing归约允许量词嵌套、布尔运算和反复调用 $Q_B$。一阶多一归约只用一次FO解释，再询问输出是否属于 $B$；上式保留不同记号。本库原有无标签归约见 [[29-df-first-order-reduction]]，此处是固定 $\\mathfrak D$ 后的显式词汇标签版本。Turing闭包是后续完全性命题的必要假设；不能仅凭NP对一阶多一归约封闭就宣称NP满足它。"},{"id":"2005f7c77a4cbc08","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo}}$ 不是本定义的 $C$ 参数实例；结构FO归约使用 [[29-df-first-order-reduction]]。"},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-94","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-first-order-reduction]]、[[29-thm-fo-query-pullback]] — 一阶归约与句子回译"},{"id":"b4d40e46b998c6d5","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3c678e2ee71047b3","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo,std}}$ 使用 [[29-df-first-order-reduction]]；$\\operatorname{Complete}$ 使用 [[29-df-completeness]]；目标查询为 $\\mathrm{QSAT}_{\\mathrm{CNF}}^{\\mathrm{std}}$，由对应问题定义的显式结构版本给出。"},{"id":"240580939d1fd13a","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo,std}}$ 使用 [[29-df-first-order-reduction]]；$\\operatorname{Complete}$ 使用 [[29-df-completeness]]；目标查询为 $\\mathrm{REACH}_a^{\\mathrm{std}}$，由对应问题定义的显式结构版本给出。"},{"id":"e33d8f1b508c3705","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depend